1
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:45,100
Excellent moves!

2
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,100
Excellent skill!

3
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:32,700
Let's go

4
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:43,300
Thanks for the pointers.
We'll have another round another day

5
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:11,500
Oh gosh, have we offended
that guy, Lord Yonghuan?

6
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:17,700
You bet. Didn't you see how ferocious
he was when he was fighting Ma-gu?

7
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:19,700
We'd have fared even worse!

8
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:23,700
It's all your fault.
You should've kept mum!

9
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:24,700
That's right

10
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:29,460
You two wanted to find out if I could
utter 3 lines with the Princess

11
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:33,100
I could even have a dialogue with
the Princess over that piece of painting

12
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:36,100
Why did you say so much when
we told you to utter just 3 lines?

13
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:41,420
What was the point of doing that?
She didn't treat you differently

14
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:43,300
Lord Yonghuan became annoyed instead

15
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:46,460
I wonder what he'd do
to do us in behind our backs

16
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:50,700
You can say whatever you like.
This thing is still in my possession

17
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:56,420
What's great about that? I'd have
picked it up if he hadn't stopped me

18
00:04:56,700 --> 00:05:01,700
-It was simply a coincidence
-What coincidence?

19
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:05,420
This isn't just another hankie,
it's a princess' hankie

20
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:08,700
It's an item I can use
to get close to the Princess

21
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:13,100
The Princess uses it
to wipe her feet!

22
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:16,700
The Princess uses it
to clear her nose!

23
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:31,100
Wei Delu?
Who does he think he is?

24
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:34,700
To think he could be Her Highness'
palace guard when he is such an ego!

25
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:36,100
I can't take it!

26
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:39,420
I get so mad when I think of
what he's said

27
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:41,460
Does he know anything about painting?

28
00:05:41,460 --> 00:05:44,700
Don't let him get under your skin.
He was just shooting his mouth off

29
00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:47,700
I think Your Lordship
produces outstanding paintings

30
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,700
That rascal is evil

31
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:52,700
I wonder how the Princess
will look at me from now on

32
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:56,700
Yes, Mei Shouquan, Wei Delu
and Wu Fuqi are nothing but jerks

33
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,700
They keep giving the yamen problems

34
00:05:58,700 --> 00:06:01,420
I just need a good excuse
to put them in their place

35
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:04,700
It'll be harder to do it
if it isn't done now

36
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:05,700
Why?

37
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:09,460
Fear not Vajra's piercing eyes
but Buddha's smiling face

38
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:13,700
I have no fear for Mei Shouquan,
Wei Delu or Wu Fuqi

39
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:16,700
Rather, it's Ma Ruyi
who is a thorn in our flesh

40
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:20,180
She is an accomplished pugilist

41
00:06:20,700 --> 00:06:25,700
She is the renowned Golden Swallow
capable of instigating discontent

42
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:29,700
We'll have a big problem if she
decides to pit herself against us

43
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,700
Your Highness,

44
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:43,700
-Master Wei is seeking an audience
-Master Wei?

45
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:47,700
The guard who said nothing good
about His Lordship's paintings

46
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:49,700
So he is the one?

47
00:06:53,460 --> 00:06:55,700
-Your Highness!
-Dispense with formality

48
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:59,700
Why did you come back?

49
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:07,700
On my way home, I chanced upon
this thing - a while silk hankie

50
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:11,460
-A white silk hankie?
-Yes

51
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:14,700
Judging from the refined embroidery,

52
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:17,460
I guess the owner
must be a person of elegance too

53
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:19,100
It must be Your Highness'

54
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:23,420
So you're holding my lost hankie.
Thank you for returning it to me

55
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:29,700
Master! Master...!

56
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:35,300
Do you feel utterly disappointed
because the hankie is mine?

57
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:37,700
You're an attendant
yet you have such a refined taste

58
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:41,300
I should think her mistress
must be a lady of outstanding calibre

59
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:44,700
Not only do you have a quick mind,
you have a glib tongue too

60
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:46,700
I thank Your Highness
for the compliment

61
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:49,700
Why don't you get a title
and serve the imperial court...

62
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:51,460
since you're such a literary talent?

63
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:53,700
Your Highness, I've always held
the view that...

64
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:57,460
the objective of learning is not always
one of winning official rank

65
00:07:57,460 --> 00:08:01,700
-However...
-That's novelty. However what?

66
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:07,420
Why don't I take the exam
since I've read so much?

67
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:09,460
I'd be able to make more friends...

68
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:12,300
while doing my part
as a filial son

69
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:15,460
Parents would invariably hold out
high expectations for their children

70
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:17,700
My father treats me the same

71
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:22,700
Unfortunately, to him,
I'm still a disappointment

72
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:24,700
Care to elaborate?

73
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:29,700
I failed in my exam
as I became the target of jealousy

74
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:32,460
I prefer not to talk about it

75
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,420
How could that be so?

76
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:38,700
The government stands to lose
if it fails to tap talents like you

77
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:41,700
I will write a note of recommendation
to the magistrate's office

78
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:45,700
You see what you can do over there.
Don't you turn it down

79
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:47,180
I will accept the offer

80
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:51,460
Oh yes, Miss Ma is your superior

81
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:55,460
I wonder if she'll have objection
to my unilateral proposition

82
00:08:58,460 --> 00:09:00,700
Miss Ma is serving Your Highness

83
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:05,700
I reckon she won't object
to Your Highness' decision

84
00:09:06,300 --> 00:09:11,300
That's better. I ever ran into
that superior of yours by chance

85
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:14,700
But it's been many years.
I can hardly recall how she looked

86
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:18,700
Miss Ma ever came to the Palace?

87
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:21,700
Miss Ma's contribution
has been outstanding

88
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:25,300
His Majesty conferred on her the title
"The No.1 Renowned Constable"...

89
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:27,300
and presented her with a gold medal

90
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:33,460
So she has His Majesty behind her.
That explains her extraordinary boldness

91
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:34,460
Come again!

92
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:41,300
The gold medal wasn't easy to come by.
I must ask Miss Ma to show it to me

93
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:47,300
What took him so long?

94
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:52,300
He should've been back by now even if
the Princess had treated him to supper

95
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:57,700
Come on,
you should've known him better

96
00:09:58,460 --> 00:10:03,420
The Princess is like fine food to
houseflies. Here comes the housefly

97
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:04,700
He must be a lecher

98
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:12,700
You're the houseflies who keep buzzing
behind my back. Aren't you a nuisance!

99
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:16,300
You crept up from behind
like a buzzing fly too!

100
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:17,700
Examine yourself first

101
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:21,700
You dropped in on the Princess.
Tell me if she's pretty

102
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:26,420
Did she say anything
when you returned her the hankie?

103
00:10:26,700 --> 00:10:32,460
The Princess was so thrilled
when she saw me

104
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:35,700
She asked me to stay
and had a chat with me

105
00:10:36,420 --> 00:10:40,700
-She said I'm one of those rare talents
-Are you sure?

106
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:45,460
Was that the only comment she made
after all that while over there?

107
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:46,500
I don't believe you

108
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:50,300
Didn't she inquire about us?
Did she?

109
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:56,700
Eager to know?
Let me take a break first

110
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,700
That rascal!

111
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:04,700
-Feeling great, eh? Swaggering, eh?
-Leave him alone!

112
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:08,300
Do you think
we still have a chance...

113
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,700
Who is she?

114
00:11:12,420 --> 00:11:13,700
Ma Ruyi!

115
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:19,420
Do you think we still
get a chance to see the Princess?

116
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:21,700
I can't wait to see her

117
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:24,300
If I'm asked to stay by her side,

118
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:27,460
I'm willing to serve her
and take care of her all my life

119
00:11:27,460 --> 00:11:28,700
So am I!

120
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:32,700
This is how close
I was looking at the Princess

121
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:36,420
Do you know how pretty
the Princess is?

122
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:40,700
I've ploughed through
thousands of books...

123
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:45,300
but I've yet to find a word
to describe how pretty she is

124
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:49,700
-Are you guys done?
-When did you come here?

125
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:54,300
The prettiest princess
is but a commoner

126
00:11:54,300 --> 00:11:57,460
I guess what she was wearing
is what I'm wearing too

127
00:11:57,700 --> 00:12:00,420
Wow, let me have a look

128
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:14,420
Indeed, an ultimate product
from heaven; a rare species on earth!

129
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:19,420
It's just our luck
we could see such a pretty lady!

130
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:23,100
Let them be donned by one of
those girls from Romance Hall,

131
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:26,700
-I bet she'll be a knock-out!
-What is Romance Hall?

132
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:31,420
How could you say that?
Those girls are so run-of-the-mill

133
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:33,300
They aren't fit to wear these clothes

134
00:12:34,700 --> 00:12:40,700
Only a princess will exude
the beauty of such beautiful clothes

135
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:46,700
Clothes?
Are you talking about my clothes?

136
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:51,420
Yeah, they're very beautiful
but nothing to do with you

137
00:12:51,420 --> 00:12:53,700
Did you think
we were talking about you?

138
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:58,420
That's what I meant by
the ultimate product from heaven

139
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:02,500
-You'd better not wear them
-Why?

140
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:05,100
You're the type
who play with swords and sabres

141
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:08,300
Such clothing gets condemned
the moment it's on you!

142
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:14,300
It was the right word you used

143
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:20,700
You look fabulous in men's outfits
but ridiculous in ladies'

144
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:40,700
Sometimes, it's better to hide
your ugly side than show it off

145
00:13:40,700 --> 00:13:44,300
You'd better use a veil
to cover your face

146
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:48,460
Indeed, your face speaks of
ferocity and malevolence

147
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:54,300
It'll scare the hell out of people
if it isn't covered!

148
00:13:55,700 --> 00:13:58,460
You guys are too civilized
to come up with anything good!

149
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:01,420
Correction - sincere advice
is often jarring to the ear

150
00:14:01,420 --> 00:14:03,700
We say it straight to your face

151
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:08,700
But other people might be sniggering
behind your back!

152
00:14:10,300 --> 00:14:15,700
Miss, heed my advice.
Put on trousers instead of a skirt

153
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:19,700
You'll only mar the beauty of a town
when you're wearing a skirt!

154
00:14:22,700 --> 00:14:27,700
-Have you said enough?!
-Hold it, I've not finished

155
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:33,700
You'd better carry the gold medal
His Majesty gave you

156
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:37,700
-What gold medal?
-Stop feigning ignorance

157
00:14:37,900 --> 00:14:41,300
The Princess told me His Majesty
ever gave you a gold medal

158
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:43,700
And it was the only one in the world

159
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:48,700
Hence, seeing the gold medal
is like seeing Golden Swallow!

160
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:53,700
Lu, are you serious the Princess
did talk to you about the gold medal?

161
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:57,420
You bet. Her Highness took me
as her confidant the moment she saw me

162
00:14:57,420 --> 00:14:59,700
She told me everything

163
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:07,300
It must be made of pure gold

164
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:12,300
I've yet to see one in my life.
Why don't you show it to us?

165
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:16,700
Yeah, I've yet to hear you talk about it
after all these years of acquaintance

166
00:15:16,700 --> 00:15:20,300
It's the least you can do
for our friendship's sake

167
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:22,300
Rest assured we won't snatch it!

168
00:15:22,700 --> 00:15:26,700
Since it's from His Majesty,
it shouldn't be shown just anyhow

169
00:15:26,700 --> 00:15:30,700
What are you doing here
at this hour? Get going!

170
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:35,700
This place is our home.
Where else can we go?

171
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:40,420
-You're still as fierce as ever
-Say that again!

172
00:15:41,460 --> 00:15:46,700
A fierce soul is still a fierce soul.
Your clothing won't change a thing

173
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:49,300
Get lost!

174
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,700
Check your temper!

175
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:58,420
My mother says a short-tempered lady
gets more wrinkles

176
00:15:58,420 --> 00:15:59,700
Say that again!

177
00:16:02,700 --> 00:16:04,300
I'm only being concerned

178
00:16:05,300 --> 00:16:06,460
Get out!!

179
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:09,700
Enough of fun?
Let's go

180
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:25,700
We must've turned Spicy Woman
into an angry fire!

181
00:16:26,700 --> 00:16:31,420
Look at the way she was trying
to suppress her fury!

182
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:35,700
Serious, don't you think
we've been unfair to her?

183
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:39,420
She does look rather pretty
in a skirt

184
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:45,420
Let her not hear us
or our plan will go bust

185
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:46,460
We'd better go

186
00:16:46,460 --> 00:16:47,700
-Where to?
-Romance Hall

187
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:50,420
Let's better go
before they close for the day...

188
00:16:50,420 --> 00:16:54,420
An imperial gold medal? So Golden
Swallow does have a gold medal

189
00:16:54,420 --> 00:16:56,300
I must get hold of it
at the first instance,

190
00:16:56,300 --> 00:16:59,100
or I'll give myself away

191
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:17,700
Golden Swallow?
How did she become like that?

192
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:27,700
Fear not.
I came to get you out of here

193
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:30,300
-Who are you?
-Ma Ruyi is my name

194
00:17:30,300 --> 00:17:32,100
I've heard of your illustrious name

195
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:34,700
I hear there is a highly-skilled
female constable in the imperial court

196
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:37,700
No bandits hear your name
without wetting their pants

197
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:39,420
It's all in the past

198
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:47,700
-Are you Golden Swallow?
-I am

199
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:51,700
What are you doing here?

200
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:55,700
It's a long story.
I got hurt thanks to a duck

201
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:57,300
A duck?

202
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:23,700
They're flying a kite!

203
00:18:27,460 --> 00:18:29,460
I've come to the right place...

204
00:18:36,180 --> 00:18:37,700
Yes, higher!

205
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:41,300
Yes, higher...!

206
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:56,100
Look!

207
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:00,100
Whose kite is that?

208
00:19:01,100 --> 00:19:03,420
It's mine, Your Highness

209
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:06,460
It's Mei Shouquan

210
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:10,300
Your Highness, hi!
Your Lordship, hi!

211
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:15,700
-You made the kite yourself?
-Yes, I did. Nice?

212
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:18,420
Very nice and big!

213
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:25,420
The kites I make are well-known
for their craftsmanship and designs

214
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:28,300
Really? Let me try yours

215
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:32,420
It's heavy

216
00:19:32,420 --> 00:19:35,700
Only when it's heavy
will it fly higher

217
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:38,700
I'll make one for Your Highness
if you so like it

218
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:42,420
-Sure, I want a butterfly
-Sure, I'll make you a big, big one!

219
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:50,300
It's flying high!

220
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:05,100
It's snapped.
Let me get it back!

221
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:15,300
Are you all right?

222
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:21,420
-Are you all right?
-Your Highness...

223
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:26,700
Please be more gentle

224
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:30,460
-Are you all right?
-I don't know. It's hurting

225
00:20:37,700 --> 00:20:43,300
They are only bruises.
He'll get well after a few days

226
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:44,460
Thank you very much

227
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:46,700
Hongying, see the guest to the door

228
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:52,420
Your Highness, His Lordship's waiting
for you out there

229
00:20:57,300 --> 00:20:58,460
Your Highness...

230
00:21:03,700 --> 00:21:05,300
Your Highness!

231
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:08,300
You're still around?

232
00:21:08,300 --> 00:21:12,700
Your Highness, I've prepared more
interesting games for you tomorrow

233
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:14,420
I don't think you need to

234
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:18,700
The physician says Shouquan needs
a few days to recover from his injury

235
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,420
I'd like to keep him company

236
00:21:20,420 --> 00:21:24,420
He is but a palace guard. Does
Your Highness have to look after him?

237
00:21:24,420 --> 00:21:27,700
He suffered the injury
because of me

238
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:31,300
I don't think I should enjoy myself
and leave him alone here

239
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:34,420
We have a well-known resident physician
in our household

240
00:21:34,420 --> 00:21:36,700
I will bring him over tomorrow
to treat your guard

241
00:21:36,700 --> 00:21:39,100
-Sure
-In that case, good day

242
00:21:44,700 --> 00:21:47,420
Isn't this method working?

243
00:21:47,700 --> 00:21:50,700
-Are you going to carry on?
-Of course

244
00:21:50,700 --> 00:21:53,420
Didn't you notice
he was full of jealousy?

245
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:58,420
-Are you all right?
-Er... Your Highness...

246
00:22:02,700 --> 00:22:07,460
Please do not say that.
I'm as robust as ever

247
00:22:07,700 --> 00:22:10,700
-You mustn't be robust
-Why not?

248
00:22:11,420 --> 00:22:14,420
I mean you couldn't have got well
so soon

249
00:22:14,420 --> 00:22:17,420
Would you like to stay here
to recuperate for another day?

250
00:22:17,420 --> 00:22:24,420
What capability do I have that I should
solicit such concern from Your Highness?

251
00:22:24,420 --> 00:22:25,420
But since Your Highness is so concerned.
I'd better heed your advice

252
00:22:25,420 --> 00:22:27,420
I will stay here for another day

253
00:22:27,420 --> 00:22:30,300
-I have another request
-You can have hundreds of requests

254
00:22:30,300 --> 00:22:35,300
I'd even be willing to risk my life
for Your Highness

255
00:22:35,300 --> 00:22:39,700
-Risking your life, serious?
-A gentleman is his word!

256
00:22:39,700 --> 00:22:42,700
In that case, please bear
with 50 strokes of beating

257
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:50,700
-Your Highness, are you pulling my leg?
-I meant what I said

258
00:22:51,700 --> 00:22:56,700
Can I retrieve the remark
about risking my life?

259
00:22:56,700 --> 00:23:00,700
You can't. You just said
a gentleman is his word. Men!

260
00:23:11,420 --> 00:23:12,420
What shall I do?

261
00:23:12,420 --> 00:23:13,700
There'll be no show...

262
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:18,700
if Ouyang Xiaotian comes here tomorrow
without seeing Mei Shouquan

263
00:23:19,300 --> 00:23:21,420
Your Highness, Golden Swallow

264
00:23:22,700 --> 00:23:23,700
Your Highness!

265
00:23:27,460 --> 00:23:30,300
Why did Shouquan pass out?
Just what happened?

266
00:23:30,300 --> 00:23:34,420
Fancy your man passing out
over a mere threat from us!

267
00:23:35,700 --> 00:23:40,100
Your Highness, they've been with me
for only a few days

268
00:23:40,100 --> 00:23:41,700
I beg Your Highness' pardon

269
00:23:42,300 --> 00:23:44,700
Forget it.
Just take him back with you

270
00:23:46,700 --> 00:23:52,460
Your Highness, I should've shown you
this gold piece when I first met you

271
00:23:52,460 --> 00:23:55,700
But I was too busy to remember it.
Please take a look

272
00:23:56,700 --> 00:24:00,700
Yes, this is the one.
Indeed you are Golden Swallow

273
00:24:01,700 --> 00:24:04,700
I've been wanting to find out
what Golden Swallow looks like

274
00:24:04,700 --> 00:24:08,300
Would you remove the veil
and let me see your face?

275
00:24:16,420 --> 00:24:17,700
You do look pretty

276
00:24:18,700 --> 00:24:22,300
-Why does the rumour say...
-That I'm ugly?

277
00:24:22,700 --> 00:24:25,300
The veil is there
for my own convenience

278
00:24:25,300 --> 00:24:28,700
Those people keep saying by word of
mouth that I'm so hopelessly ugly

279
00:24:28,700 --> 00:24:30,700
I don't see the need to explain

280
00:24:47,700 --> 00:24:49,420
This is your work place

281
00:24:50,100 --> 00:24:52,700
What am I supposed to do
at such a place?

282
00:24:55,300 --> 00:24:56,700
This is the place

283
00:24:59,700 --> 00:25:01,100
This is the place?

284
00:25:02,700 --> 00:25:05,700
Sir, I doubt you'd want me
to do something so lowdown

285
00:25:05,700 --> 00:25:08,700
My interest is to take part
in local government,

286
00:25:08,700 --> 00:25:11,700
eradicate malpractices
and develop Ping-an

287
00:25:11,700 --> 00:25:14,700
Master Wei,
you take a step at a time

288
00:25:14,700 --> 00:25:18,420
First do a good job of organizing
these books on the shelves...

289
00:25:18,420 --> 00:25:20,420
and compiling the local encyclopaedia

290
00:25:20,420 --> 00:25:21,700
The rest can wait

291
00:25:21,700 --> 00:25:24,700
Right now, I have something else
to attend to!

292
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:28,700
Sir! Sir...!

293
00:25:32,700 --> 00:25:33,700
Sir!

294
00:25:37,700 --> 00:25:41,700
We are all neighbours.
Do drop by when you're free...

295
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:47,420
Lu, your father told us
you'd been made an official

296
00:25:47,420 --> 00:25:51,300
What's your title?
Can you show us your seal?

297
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:54,700
Is it an 8th-grade or 9th-grade
official?

298
00:25:55,460 --> 00:25:57,700
Just forget it
if it's too low a position

299
00:25:59,700 --> 00:26:01,100
Wow, such airs!

300
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:07,460
What's wrong with you?
Don't give me that face...

301
00:26:07,460 --> 00:26:11,300
Please leave me alone.
You have such a big mouth!

302
00:26:13,420 --> 00:26:17,700
Since when was our Master Wu forced to
engage in the flesh trade in Fengyue?

303
00:26:19,700 --> 00:26:22,300
It isn't the flesh trade, mind you!

304
00:26:25,700 --> 00:26:29,300
You've been doing menial work
from morning to night

305
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:32,700
Isn't it as good as
engaging in the flesh trade?

306
00:26:34,300 --> 00:26:38,700
Tell me if you're happy
with this new hand we've got

307
00:26:38,700 --> 00:26:45,700
Oh my, fancy one of the three vermins
in Ping-an being reduced to a waiter!

308
00:26:45,700 --> 00:26:50,420
He used to behave like a big bully.
Now it's our turn to order him about!

309
00:26:50,700 --> 00:26:54,420
What are you standing there for?
Get cracking, go!

310
00:27:02,700 --> 00:27:04,300
Let me tell you this:

311
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:08,700
I'm an itinerant pugilist
who doesn't shirk my responsibility

312
00:27:09,420 --> 00:27:12,700
I can take on any tough job
and bear with any suffering

313
00:27:13,300 --> 00:27:18,300
But I do beg you to stop saying
I'm engaging in the flesh trade!

314
00:27:55,700 --> 00:27:58,700
-Why did you slap me?
-How long have you been practising this?

315
00:27:59,700 --> 00:28:02,300
Every day and every moment

316
00:28:02,300 --> 00:28:05,700
But I'm a little plump.
I'm not as agile

317
00:28:06,460 --> 00:28:08,700
You've not done well
because you've been finding excuses

318
00:28:08,700 --> 00:28:10,700
Your movements lack the agility

319
00:28:10,700 --> 00:28:13,300
They fail to bring out
the essence of "Five Animal Boxing"

320
00:28:13,300 --> 00:28:17,420
What is shadow-boxing? Isn't it all
about one robust stroke after another?

321
00:28:18,420 --> 00:28:19,420
Wrong!

322
00:28:19,420 --> 00:28:21,700
Five Animal Boxing is designed
mainly for self-protection

323
00:28:21,700 --> 00:28:23,700
The strokes consist mainly of
slow and gentle movements

324
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:27,460
If executed correctly, it's capable
of deflecting blows and assaults

325
00:28:27,460 --> 00:28:29,300
Who says it's one robust stroke
after another?

326
00:28:29,300 --> 00:28:31,460
It's termed as diffusing hard blows
with gentle strokes, get it?

327
00:28:31,460 --> 00:28:32,460
I don't

328
00:28:32,460 --> 00:28:36,700
Jiu Jin simply tapped you
and you fell to the ground

329
00:28:36,700 --> 00:28:38,460
That's diffusing hard blows
with gentle strokes

330
00:28:39,100 --> 00:28:43,460
You must feel and understand the strokes
before you're able to use them at will

331
00:28:43,460 --> 00:28:47,300
Rote learning would only stop you
from giving full play to their power

332
00:28:47,300 --> 00:28:51,460
The beauty of the boxing lies in
blending yourself with the environment

333
00:28:51,460 --> 00:28:54,300
Use the force coming at you
to your advantage

334
00:28:54,300 --> 00:28:57,420
Use the force coming at you
to your advantage...

335
00:28:58,700 --> 00:29:01,460
-The death of me!
-You'll kill me!

336
00:29:03,420 --> 00:29:07,460
-Jiu Jin, are you feeding your uncle?
-I'm not

337
00:29:07,460 --> 00:29:10,700
Uncle says he has no appetite
and has gastric problem

338
00:29:11,420 --> 00:29:15,300
Gastric problem? But I told him
to take less greasy food

339
00:29:32,300 --> 00:29:35,420
Gastric problem, indeed.
Stop deceiving me!

340
00:29:35,420 --> 00:29:38,300
Who says I have gastric problem?
Did you?

341
00:29:38,300 --> 00:29:42,700
Jiu Jin said that?
She's fond of guess-talking

342
00:29:43,700 --> 00:29:46,420
I'm fully well.
I'm going to exercise

343
00:29:48,300 --> 00:29:51,700
What you said is right:
Want a healthy day? Do it every day

344
00:29:52,700 --> 00:29:56,300
This is the qigong manual.
I will do it with you!

345
00:29:58,700 --> 00:30:02,300
Didn't you want me to tell you
the story of Grandpa Rabbit?

346
00:30:02,300 --> 00:30:04,700
I'm not good at telling stories.
Your sister is

347
00:30:07,420 --> 00:30:11,700
Sister, will you tell me how
a rabbit becomes a grandpa rabbit?

348
00:30:12,700 --> 00:30:14,420
It's a long story

349
00:30:14,420 --> 00:30:18,700
Let me buy you a grandpa rabbit
and I'll tell you the story

350
00:30:22,700 --> 00:30:24,300
Sorry, sold out!

351
00:30:24,700 --> 00:30:28,300
So early in the day?
It's not my day!

352
00:30:31,700 --> 00:30:35,420
Sorry, it's under renovation -
closed for the day!

353
00:30:40,460 --> 00:30:42,700
Sir, how much is a jin
of this roast duck?

354
00:30:42,700 --> 00:30:44,300
Sorry, it's taken

355
00:30:44,700 --> 00:30:47,700
-What about this roast chicken?
-They're all taken

356
00:30:48,300 --> 00:30:49,460
Stop!

357
00:30:53,700 --> 00:30:56,700
Madam, I'm thirsty.
A glass of tea for me, please

358
00:30:56,700 --> 00:30:58,420
-None
-Why none?

359
00:30:58,420 --> 00:31:01,460
-Aren't you selling tea?
-In the past

360
00:31:01,460 --> 00:31:02,700
What about today?

361
00:31:02,700 --> 00:31:06,700
Only tea for expectant mothers
and facial care

362
00:31:07,700 --> 00:31:10,300
It's just my luck.
Leave it!

363
00:31:12,700 --> 00:31:15,700
-Do come to our eatery
-Why should I?

364
00:31:21,700 --> 00:31:23,300
It's you again!

365
00:31:23,300 --> 00:31:26,700
Why can't you leave me alone
and let me have a break?

366
00:31:26,700 --> 00:31:28,460
Why do you have such a fiery temper?

367
00:31:28,460 --> 00:31:31,700
A spread of blander foods
will help smother the fire!

368
00:31:31,700 --> 00:31:34,700
A bowl of light soup
is better than a wad of prescriptions

369
00:31:34,700 --> 00:31:37,700
Drink more tea
and have less bad teeth!

370
00:31:37,700 --> 00:31:42,300
I see. Did you ask the entire street
not to sell me anything?

371
00:31:42,300 --> 00:31:46,700
I walked the whole day and I got not
even a piece of bone or a sip of water

372
00:31:46,700 --> 00:31:48,460
Are you starving me to death?

373
00:31:48,460 --> 00:31:51,700
Indeed I was behind it. Blame yourselves
for sneaking out without telling me

374
00:31:51,700 --> 00:31:55,460
Miss, I have no wish of eating you.
What do you want me to eat?

375
00:31:55,460 --> 00:31:58,460
Excessive food's bad for the stomach;
unwarranted trouble's bad for the mind

376
00:31:58,460 --> 00:32:01,460
Food is the source
of so many illnesses

377
00:32:02,300 --> 00:32:05,420
You seem so fond of expounding your
theory and eating vegetarian food

378
00:32:05,420 --> 00:32:07,700
You might as well be a nun
instead of a constable

379
00:32:07,700 --> 00:32:10,420
This is vegetarian food.
Aren't you eating?

380
00:32:10,700 --> 00:32:13,700
Why shouldn't I eat?
I'm starving!

381
00:32:16,700 --> 00:32:19,420
Even vegetable food
is so palatable to you

382
00:32:19,420 --> 00:32:21,300
It's therefore a matter of habits

383
00:32:21,300 --> 00:32:23,700
Eating is the greatest fun in life

384
00:32:24,300 --> 00:32:26,420
How can you be a human
if you know not how to eat?

385
00:32:26,420 --> 00:32:28,700
Is it still fun
if it gives rise to illnesses?

386
00:32:28,700 --> 00:32:32,300
You can always cure them.
Why do you need a mouth, otherwise?

387
00:32:32,300 --> 00:32:35,700
But there are so many things
you can do in life other than eating?

388
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:40,300
If you aren't allowed
to eat so many things in life,

389
00:32:40,300 --> 00:32:42,460
it's as good as a living dead!

390
00:32:43,300 --> 00:32:45,700
Truly stubborn and impervious!

391
00:32:45,700 --> 00:32:52,300
Why don't you give up on me
if you think that's the case?

392
00:32:52,700 --> 00:32:55,460
These foods are good.
Thank you

393
00:32:58,700 --> 00:33:01,420
Give up on you?
It's just a starter!

394
00:33:01,420 --> 00:33:04,420
You had to take the vegetables!

395
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:19,420
Why can't I hammer you?

396
00:33:20,300 --> 00:33:23,700
You're employed to work
and not to have a nap!

397
00:33:24,700 --> 00:33:27,700
You're here to maintain
peace and security, get it?

398
00:33:27,700 --> 00:33:31,700
Those of us who are working here
should set ourselves as examples

399
00:33:31,700 --> 00:33:34,300
-Don't you know?
-We don't

400
00:33:34,700 --> 00:33:37,460
We did work very hard.
We were only taking a nap

401
00:33:37,460 --> 00:33:42,700
You'd better get cracking
or I'll have all of you replaced!

402
00:34:02,700 --> 00:34:04,300
How come it's here?

403
00:34:09,700 --> 00:34:11,420
I'm a nightsoil man

404
00:34:15,700 --> 00:34:18,420
Why did you leave it here
for so long?

405
00:34:18,420 --> 00:34:21,420
We used to come before daybreak

406
00:34:21,420 --> 00:34:24,300
But you complained about us coming
too early without much to take away

407
00:34:24,300 --> 00:34:28,700
Now it's too late. Officials like you
are so hard to please

408
00:34:28,700 --> 00:34:30,300
I see

409
00:34:31,700 --> 00:34:36,700
Why don't you come
twice a day instead?

410
00:34:36,700 --> 00:34:39,700
Once in the morning and once
before nightfall. Agreeable?

411
00:34:39,700 --> 00:34:46,700
No way. Yours isn't the only place
I have to cover. Twice is no go

412
00:34:48,700 --> 00:34:52,700
Why do you have so much nightsoil?
How many times do you do it a day?

413
00:34:53,420 --> 00:34:54,420
Hold it!

414
00:34:54,700 --> 00:35:00,700
Why are you so long-winded? I'll have
you replaced if you aren't doing it

415
00:35:00,700 --> 00:35:05,420
Go ahead if you have what it takes.
I'm not so hard up!

416
00:35:26,700 --> 00:35:33,300
That shrew of a woman
keeps forcing us to study

417
00:35:33,300 --> 00:35:35,700
I bet she'll drive us crazy
if this goes on

418
00:35:35,700 --> 00:35:38,700
Lu, you knew better
to equip yourself with knowledge

419
00:35:38,700 --> 00:35:40,300
She doesn't dare lord it over you

420
00:35:41,700 --> 00:35:46,700
I thought I could take her down
a peg or two by being an official

421
00:35:46,700 --> 00:35:51,420
To my astonishment, even a nightsoil man
could raise his voice at me!

422
00:35:51,420 --> 00:35:56,460
Don't tell me the three of us would give
in and let that shrew order us around?

423
00:35:56,700 --> 00:36:00,100
We must think of a way
to shake her off

424
00:36:00,700 --> 00:36:02,300
Think, my foot!

425
00:36:03,300 --> 00:36:06,300
We can neither outbeat
nor out-talk her

426
00:36:06,300 --> 00:36:11,300
She has many talents.
The three of us are doomed!

427
00:36:11,700 --> 00:36:17,420
Not quite. There must be a chink
in her armour. She isn't so formidable

428
00:36:18,700 --> 00:36:25,700
You're wrong. This girl is fearless.
What chink can she possibly have?

429
00:36:28,460 --> 00:36:30,300
Hey, let's try this...

430
00:36:35,460 --> 00:36:37,700
-Will it work?
-It will

431
00:36:38,420 --> 00:36:41,700
-You're pervert
-Have faith in me

432
00:36:41,700 --> 00:36:45,460
No girls have ever slipped through.
Foolproof!

433
00:36:47,420 --> 00:36:49,700
The three of you
are engaging in whispering!

434
00:36:51,300 --> 00:36:55,420
-Just what are you hatching?
-We won't dare

435
00:36:56,300 --> 00:36:59,460
With you popping up now and then,
we'll have no chance at all

436
00:36:59,700 --> 00:37:03,300
You won't dare? You even dare peep
at the Princess and bribe courtesans

437
00:37:03,300 --> 00:37:06,420
My advice to you is that
you'd better behave

438
00:37:09,700 --> 00:37:12,300
Since you talked about the Princess,
it sort of crossed my mind

439
00:37:12,300 --> 00:37:15,700
Why aren't you shadowing her
and giving her protection?

440
00:37:15,700 --> 00:37:18,460
How come you could while away
your time at this place?

441
00:37:19,460 --> 00:37:23,420
The Princess has just too many guards
to let me bother about her

442
00:37:24,700 --> 00:37:26,300
Not quite

443
00:37:26,300 --> 00:37:31,300
You shouldn't go back on your word
since you've promised to protect her

444
00:37:32,300 --> 00:37:37,700
You're the No.1 constable.
You must be absolutely trustworthy

445
00:37:39,300 --> 00:37:42,300
I thought of such a ruse
to save you guys

446
00:37:42,300 --> 00:37:45,700
If I was with the Princess, who would
know what the three of you are doing?

447
00:37:45,700 --> 00:37:49,460
Please stop using us as your shield,
will you?

448
00:37:49,460 --> 00:37:52,300
Fact is the three of us
care a lot about you

449
00:37:52,300 --> 00:37:56,700
-We understand how you feel
-What do you understand?

450
00:37:57,420 --> 00:38:00,700
The Princess is an elegant lady
with imperial blood

451
00:38:00,700 --> 00:38:05,420
You're afraid you might be reduced
to some weed if you stand next to her

452
00:38:07,700 --> 00:38:11,100
The shadow of a mountain
is what a plane is most afraid of

453
00:38:11,100 --> 00:38:15,300
The contrast will show up right away
which one is taller

454
00:38:16,700 --> 00:38:18,100
Lu is right

455
00:38:20,460 --> 00:38:24,300
We humans are most afraid of comparison.
It can be most frustrating

456
00:38:27,700 --> 00:38:29,100
Please stay with us!

457
00:38:44,420 --> 00:38:48,460
Your Highness, this is the hundred-
flower wine I've prepared for you

458
00:38:48,700 --> 00:38:52,300
It's made of 100 different types
of flowers I ordered picked

459
00:38:52,300 --> 00:38:53,460
Please try some

460
00:38:53,460 --> 00:38:57,700
You must've put in lots of effort.
I must try some

461
00:38:59,460 --> 00:39:00,700
So long as Your Highness likes it,

462
00:39:00,700 --> 00:39:04,300
I won't complain even if
I had to put in more effort

463
00:39:04,300 --> 00:39:07,700
-How do you feel?
-It tastes very strong

464
00:39:08,460 --> 00:39:12,100
It's pungent too.
I could even smell it

465
00:39:12,700 --> 00:39:14,700
Your Lordship, it needs to be improved

466
00:39:16,700 --> 00:39:21,700
It sounds as if you're an expert
in brewing wine

467
00:39:21,700 --> 00:39:23,100
But of course

468
00:39:23,100 --> 00:39:26,300
Youg Highness, there are formulas
governing wine-making

469
00:39:26,300 --> 00:39:28,460
Hundred Flowers ought to have
a touch of colour and fragrance

470
00:39:28,460 --> 00:39:31,300
But His Lordship's wine
is heavy in colour and taste

471
00:39:31,300 --> 00:39:33,700
He must've shortened the time
needed to brew it

472
00:39:33,700 --> 00:39:36,700
More haste, less speed, Your Lordship!

473
00:39:37,420 --> 00:39:40,700
To think my guard has to teach the
refined marquis one thing or two...

474
00:39:40,700 --> 00:39:42,300
about making wine

475
00:39:42,700 --> 00:39:46,420
It tickles me.
Marquis, that's rather embarrassing

476
00:39:47,700 --> 00:39:51,700
Your Highness, I've asked my men
to prepare a mutton feast for you

477
00:39:51,700 --> 00:39:55,300
-Have you?
-I have. It's the best mutton available

478
00:39:55,300 --> 00:39:58,460
Sorry, the chef said his daughter-
in-law was giving birth soon

479
00:39:58,460 --> 00:40:00,300
His village custom dictates
that he shouldn't kill

480
00:40:00,300 --> 00:40:02,420
I've asked him to prepare
a vegetarian feast instead

481
00:40:02,420 --> 00:40:08,420
Miss Ma, it was my idea.
You should at least ask me first

482
00:40:08,420 --> 00:40:11,460
It's fine with me. My usual diet
consists of lots of fish and meat

483
00:40:11,460 --> 00:40:14,300
It's not a bad idea
to have vegetables

484
00:40:14,700 --> 00:40:17,700
Miss Ma, you aren't required
at this place anymore. You may leave

485
00:40:17,700 --> 00:40:19,100
But Her Highness...

486
00:40:19,100 --> 00:40:20,700
I want to reminisce about
the past with Her Highness

487
00:40:20,700 --> 00:40:22,700
It may not be appropriate
to have outsiders

488
00:40:22,700 --> 00:40:24,700
-But...
-It's all right

489
00:40:24,700 --> 00:40:28,300
You may leave.
I'll send for you if I need you

490
00:40:35,700 --> 00:40:42,300
That woman is indeed very loyal to you.
She doesn't leave you alone for a moment

491
00:40:42,700 --> 00:40:47,420
Since she isn't around,
we may drink to our hearts' content

492
00:40:47,420 --> 00:40:50,300
I've got sick
of eating and drinking

493
00:40:50,300 --> 00:40:52,700
Why don't you coach me
on swordplay instead?

494
00:40:52,700 --> 00:40:55,700
Oh no, Your Highness
is the Emperor's daughter

495
00:40:55,700 --> 00:41:00,420
It isn't fitting of Your Highness to
be wielding a sword like a boorish man

496
00:41:00,420 --> 00:41:04,420
A boorish man? Miss Ma
is a fine swordswoman too

497
00:41:04,420 --> 00:41:08,700
A constable can't be compared
with Your Highness

498
00:41:09,460 --> 00:41:12,700
Let's not talk about this subject

499
00:41:12,700 --> 00:41:17,300
You can make any other request.
I promise I will do it as told

500
00:41:17,300 --> 00:41:20,420
-Is that true?
-I've never reneged on my promise

501
00:41:20,420 --> 00:41:24,300
Your Highness will have every right
to punish me if I fail

502
00:41:24,300 --> 00:41:27,700
I'd like to see peach blossoms.
Can you make it come true?

503
00:41:27,700 --> 00:41:29,420
What's so difficult about that?

504
00:41:29,420 --> 00:41:32,700
You'll see plenty of peach blossoms
come the 3rd or 4th month

505
00:41:32,700 --> 00:41:37,700
I'll have gone back to the Capital.
I want to see them now!

506
00:41:39,700 --> 00:41:44,700
-But the flowers don't bloom in winter
-Haven't I checkmated you?

507
00:41:54,700 --> 00:41:58,300
-Why the hell are you so careless?
-I'm sorry...

508
00:41:58,700 --> 00:42:00,420
I'll do it myself

509
00:42:00,420 --> 00:42:03,420
They're about Lord Yonghuan's residence.
Nobody else should touch them

510
00:42:08,420 --> 00:42:10,700
What are they?
They look strange

511
00:42:11,420 --> 00:42:14,700
They're just drawings.
No need to get so alarmed!

512
00:42:19,100 --> 00:42:22,700
No big deal. How come people from
the marquis' household are so fierce?

513
00:42:24,700 --> 00:42:28,460
I asked the marquis to teach me
swordplay but he refused repeatedly

514
00:42:29,300 --> 00:42:33,300
Miss Ma, you're a fine pugilist.
What about teaching me swordplay?

515
00:42:33,300 --> 00:42:35,700
I'm only good at climbing walls
and rooftops

516
00:42:35,700 --> 00:42:39,460
In that case, I must
learn a trick or two from you

517
00:42:39,700 --> 00:42:41,700
But Your Highness
is the Emperor's daughter

518
00:42:41,700 --> 00:42:44,420
How can you climb rooftops
in the middle of the night?

519
00:42:44,420 --> 00:42:47,700
Not only do I want to climb rooftops,

520
00:42:47,700 --> 00:42:49,700
I want to try
being a female pugilist too

521
00:42:49,700 --> 00:42:50,700
Female pugilist?

522
00:42:51,700 --> 00:42:53,700
Your Highness, you're a princess

523
00:42:53,700 --> 00:42:56,300
You can't run all over the place
in the dark

524
00:42:56,300 --> 00:42:59,300
People will start gossiping
if they come to know about it

525
00:42:59,300 --> 00:43:02,420
Why should you fear when I have
the best constable to go with me?

526
00:43:04,700 --> 00:43:07,420
-A place came to my mind!
-Yes?

527
00:43:07,420 --> 00:43:09,460
The military camp at Sanlipo

528
00:43:09,460 --> 00:43:13,700
-Fine, let's go there
-In that case, let's go now

529
00:43:32,420 --> 00:43:34,300
So it's so much thrill and fun

530
00:43:35,460 --> 00:43:38,420
It's a restricted zone.
Please don't raise your voice!

531
00:43:38,700 --> 00:43:40,700
I was so overwhelmed!

532
00:44:02,300 --> 00:44:07,420
Wow, there are so many weapons.
How did you know this place?

533
00:44:07,420 --> 00:44:10,420
I saw it from a drawing
Master Chen was holding

534
00:44:10,420 --> 00:44:15,700
Does Lord Yonghuan own this place?
Why does he need so many weapons?

535
00:44:23,700 --> 00:44:29,700
Xiaotian is a sword-lover who has plenty
of swords in his private collection

536
00:44:29,700 --> 00:44:32,700
It's no surprise to me
if he has a firearm workshop

537
00:44:32,700 --> 00:44:36,700
But these weapons are more than enough
to obliterate 10 Ping-an Towns!

538
00:44:36,700 --> 00:44:39,300
He doesn't possibly want
to wipe out Ping-an

539
00:44:39,300 --> 00:44:43,300
He must've felt tired of playing
with swords. This is something new

540
00:44:43,700 --> 00:44:46,300
Someone's here.
Let's go!

541
00:45:01,700 --> 00:45:02,780
Subtitles: H Yap


